    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/56747d5ae002581a88b8d061d5a08ac5.avif?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Awaken!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slay SKELET_666!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Head to Old Arath!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Forgoten Sword to the kingdom old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/cf2705eaae06379dde5125d98a07c00b.webp?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=57 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/9476cafff07619c89f77e21aab073b2d.avif?t=1750238302\" width=394 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/cf2705eaae06379dde5125d98a07c00b.webp?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vintage FPS: First Person <i>~Slasher~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If will face enemies on your way \u2014 <strong>then fight!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay, hew, stab your enemy performing complex attacks and long continuos combos.<br>The combat system is pretty close to fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/c4ebfbf5dd7daa7ff4cd6492527f65c5.poster.avif?t=1750238302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/c4ebfbf5dd7daa7ff4cd6492527f65c5.webm?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/c4ebfbf5dd7daa7ff4cd6492527f65c5.mp4?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Stab(<i>m2) + Upper(R) + Strike(m1).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Down in the <i>~Crypt~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If will face dungeon on your way \u2014 <strong>then loot!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot your own grave...<br>Come trough olden crypts, elder castles and doleful ruins of once great kingdom Arath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/127f77154abea1098826d94d9f7e2acf.poster.avif?t=1750238302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/127f77154abea1098826d94d9f7e2acf.webm?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/127f77154abea1098826d94d9f7e2acf.mp4?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Real archaeological artifacts.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give in to that <i>~DEADLY STYLISH~</i> aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If will face shameless kitsch on your way \u2014 <strong>then fear not!</strong> <br>Accept that mix of genres and styles.  <br>Fall into that postmodernistic vintage atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/9ff3ec257a0b8d0a92c6692b9c12bcd0.poster.avif?t=1750238302\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/9ff3ec257a0b8d0a92c6692b9c12bcd0.webm?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/9ff3ec257a0b8d0a92c6692b9c12bcd0.mp4?t=1750238302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Audio-visual simulation of various retro platforms.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/cf2705eaae06379dde5125d98a07c00b.webp?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=57 /></span>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  <br><i>Surely you won't be fooled by the generic-fantasy exterior,  right?</i> <br>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by <strong>GZD</strong>oom</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/56747d5ae002581a88b8d061d5a08ac5.avif?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Awaken!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slay SKELET_666!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Head to Old Arath!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Forgoten Sword to the kingdom old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/cf2705eaae06379dde5125d98a07c00b.webp?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=57 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/9476cafff07619c89f77e21aab073b2d.avif?t=1750238302\" width=394 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/cf2705eaae06379dde5125d98a07c00b.webp?t=1750238302\" width=540 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vintage FPS: First Person <i>~Slasher~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If will face enemies on your way \u2014 <strong>then fight!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay, hew, stab your enemy performing complex attacks and long continuos combos.<br>The combat system is pretty close to fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893320/extras/c4ebfbf5dd7daa7ff4cd6492527f65c5.poster.avif?t=1750238302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s